title CLI Context Command Flow

participant "User" as User
participant "ContextCommand" as CLI
participant "ContextProvider" as Provider
participant "IndexProvider" as Index
participant "FileCacheStore" as Cache
participant "Semantic Cache" as Semantic

note over User, Semantic: === Context File Command (Basic) ===

User->CLI: context file --path=AuthService.kt
activate CLI

CLI->CLI: Extract module path from file path
CLI->Provider: ContextProvider(projectRoot, cacheStore)
activate Provider

CLI->Provider: hasDiscoveryCache(modulePath)
activate Provider
Provider->Cache: Check module cache directory
Cache->Semantic: Check if .semantic-cache/module/flow exists
Semantic-->Cache: Cache status
Cache-->Provider: Cache exists (true/false)
Provider-->CLI: Cache status
deactivate Provider

alt Cache exists
    CLI->User: "[ENHANCED] Discovery cache available"
    CLI->User: "Run discovery for enhanced analysis"
else No cache
    CLI->User: "[BASIC] Context (symbols + complexity)"
    CLI->User: "Run discovery for enhanced: i2vision discover --intent=full_discovery"
end

CLI->Provider: getContext(filePath, task)
activate Provider

Provider->Index: Extract symbols from source code
activate Index
Index->Index: Parse file AST
Index->Index: Extract classes, functions, properties
Index-->Provider: Symbol list
deactivate Index

Provider->Provider: Calculate complexity metrics
Provider->Provider: Generate task-specific suggestions
Provider->Provider: Get strategy suggestions

Provider-->CLI: InstantContext(symbols, complexity, suggestions)
deactivate Provider

CLI->User: Display symbols, complexity, suggestions
deactivate CLI

note over User, Semantic: === Context Enhanced Command ===

User->CLI: context enhanced --path=AuthService.kt
activate CLI

CLI->Provider: hasDiscoveryCache(modulePath)
activate Provider
Provider->Cache: Check module cache directory
Cache->Semantic: Check if .semantic-cache/module/flow exists
Semantic-->Cache: Cache status
Cache-->Provider: Cache exists (true/false)
Provider-->CLI: Cache status
deactivate Provider

alt No cache
    CLI->User: "Error: No discovery cache found"
    CLI->User: "Run discovery first: i2vision discover --intent=full_discovery"
    CLI->CLI: Throw exception
else Cache exists
    CLI->Provider: getContext(filePath, task)
    activate Provider
    
    note right of Provider: Future enhancement:\nLoad flows from cache\nLoad business rules from cache\nLoad components from cache
    
    Provider->Index: Extract symbols from source code
    activate Index
    Index->Index: Parse file AST
    Index->Index: Extract classes, functions, properties
    Index-->Provider: Symbol list
    deactivate Index
    
    Provider->Provider: Calculate complexity metrics
    Provider->Provider: Generate task-specific suggestions
    Provider->Provider: Get strategy suggestions
    
    Provider-->CLI: InstantContext(symbols, complexity, suggestions)
    deactivate Provider
    
    CLI->User: "[ENHANCED] Discovery cache available"
    CLI->User: Display context with future flows/rules/components
end

deactivate CLI

note over User, Semantic: === Context Cache Commands ===

User->CLI: context cache stats
activate CLI
CLI->Provider: getCacheStats()
activate Provider
Provider->Cache: Get cache statistics
Cache-->Provider: CacheStats(totalEntries, expiredEntries, validEntries)
Provider-->CLI: Cache stats
CLI->User: Display cache statistics
deactivate Provider
deactivate CLI

User->CLI: context cache clean
activate CLI
CLI->Provider: cleanCache()
activate Provider
Provider->Cache: Remove expired entries
Cache-->Provider: Success
Provider-->CLI: Success
CLI->User: "Cache cleaned successfully"
deactivate Provider
deactivate CLI

User->CLI: context cache invalidate --pattern=*.kt
activate CLI
CLI->Provider: invalidateCache("*.kt")
activate Provider
Provider->Cache: Invalidate matching entries
Cache-->Provider: Success
Provider-->CLI: Success
CLI->User: "Cache invalidated for pattern: *.kt"
deactivate Provider
deactivate CLI
